{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"9月9日から始まりましたヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"連載40周年特別企画 舞台版『こちら葛飾区亀有公園前派出所』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サキ役として出させて頂いておりますヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は3日目でございます！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初日、2日目観に来て下さった方ありがとうございましたヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもの生駒ちゃんを応援して下さっている方はきっとびっくりしたかと思いまする笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんな私でも、何とかやってます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こち亀ファンの方、舞台ファンの方はどう感じられたのでしょうか。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだまだ未熟な私です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"舞台経験も、特別お芝居が上手い訳でも、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"歌が歌える訳でもない。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな私が今この瞬間、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここに立っているのが凄い奇跡だと思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やはり、難しいです(´；ω；｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも凄く楽しいです！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私の周りにいる方は皆さん強烈に素晴らしい方達です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その中にいると100メートル走を連続で100回走ってるくらいに色んな事を感じます！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"言い方は失礼かも知れませんが物凄く頭使うのでクラクラしますヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今の私じゃ完璧に理解出来ないものが沢山あります。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、今ここに立たせて頂ける事の意味を、価値を考えてもっと面白いものを作りたいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に、私って。。。・゜・(ノД`)・゜・。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"不器用。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一度出来たものに自信を持つと途端に出来なくなるの。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自信を持つって良い事なのに。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなにかけられる言葉なのに。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"持つと出来なくなる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんな事いって、いいわけ(´；ω；｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あぁ、、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな簡単に進化しないけどさ、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こういう自分ほんと腹立つ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あーきらいだっっっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"優しい人ばかりで、私にプラスになる様に声をかけて下さっているのに。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やれない自分にグーパンチしたいっっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それして出来たらもう出来てるよね笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"甘いんだな自分に。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やれ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"つべこべ言わずにやれ〜自分〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"っとこんな訳わからん事言ってごめんなさい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/09/11/5791252/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今それだけ新しい刺激に大興奮しているのです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"人間として分からない事だらけだし、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"未経験だらけなんだなぁ私。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"っと思ったよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うんっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日も頑張りますっ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"歌しっかり歌え自分っ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"動けっ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/09/11/5791252/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コープスファミリーの末っ子ほのちゃん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/09/11/5791252/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/09/11/5791252/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうすぐ生駒ちゃんの身長こすんじゃないかとお姉さんハラハラしてます あゆちゃん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/09/11/5791252/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"可愛い可愛いコープスファミリーの妹達が来てくれましたっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/09/11/5791252/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"癒しだよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/09/11/5791252/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂のメンバーも来てくれて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久々メンバーの顔みれて嬉しかった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱり安心するっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/09/11/5791252/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"犬天で共演したニーコさんも来てくださいましたっヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/09/11/5791252/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"早くニーコさんち遊びに行かなきゃ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うんっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"落ち着いたっっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頑張りますっヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"へばなっ☆彡"}],"source":"archive"}